  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap rose 2.2% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $303.04B (2.2% higher over 30D) implies fresh dry powder entering crypto rails\u2014usually a constructive backdrop for settlement, trading, and on-chain cash demand. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxPM1phN2dFa2NFUXRIbjdFa1l6Y0h3eXhMeEhva1ZfTy1LQWNWRGFpai1KQm9YUjktR3NEaDU3b19fOGdBZ1UtU1ZGTHhXSE9md0tFN1RkVl9sX2QxdUt1Mk1PX1hyQTBEbXJFMThIOVUxSjZpbS1TdFRRSDhTTFlrVnVfWlFkWnFISjVsU20xek9uSWZ6Vm51d3hFVVl4NDM5MW5MTERfWWRmTzBBWm96R05OaWdRWnkwd2ZlV2UzdXhlTlQ0ZmVkc0dMd0k?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">KiiChain Integrates TRON to Expand 24/7 On-Chain FX and Stablecoin Payments</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://decrypt.co/376575/revolut-launches-euro-pegged-eurr-stablecoin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Revolut Launches Euro-Pegged EURR Stablecoin</a> (Decrypt).</li><li><strong>Policy and reserves are resetting issuer priorities:</strong> Issuer and platform share can shift before aggregate market cap does, because policy and reserve quality determine which names institutions will hold. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxQWDU5RngxaGV2RjlsQ2s2Mk9JSXFPcVhZNldoM2NsaUV6YTRWM3VOQldpaVZvd2tnTmpKSnFPdFJQTm9Mc0htdFRjcXVhczB3c3ZJSVM1NUl5Z0o4bTYycDBzZ29OZlJCY1FGSlZiOHY2M3pkVnRBQ1ZZOWViR0VpaG1uZWZvNTc1LVVYZDhWUWdVMTVfMTBqYWpiWWtNeE1GaWl0TlVDblhIT3ZFN01HbU1qYjJZQ29uZzJnY3Bwaw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">South Korea&#x27;s Shinhan Financial taps Visa to build AI and stablecoin payments</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
